    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. just to be clear regarding the insurance part—is there a minimum level of coverage they're required to provide under CIF? i want to make sure they aren't cutting corners on the policy since these semiconductors are high value.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
