      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "CIF generally requires the seller to obtain insurance coverage equivalent to at least 110% of the contract price under Institute Cargo Clauses (C). While this is the minimum standard, because your semiconductors are high-value, you should explicitly request higher-level coverage, such as Institute Cargo Clauses (A), for maximum protection. Always review the policy wording carefully to ensure it meets your risk tolerance for such valuable electronics.",
